OL,3,AEurope plans to catch the next computer
OL,4,Achip wave
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey process data by shunting electrons
OL,7,Faround tiny circuits ` a single
OL,8,Fmicrochip produced today can contain
OL,9,Fbillions of transistors, and sizes are
OL,10,Fmeasured in nanometres (one nanometre
OL,11,Fis a billionth of a metre).
